{"statements": ["Entry‑level cloud engineer roles commonly look for practical experience with cloud platforms, infrastructure‑as‑code, scripting, monitoring, and basic software development concepts.", "Hands‑on experience with AWS, Azure, and/or Google Cloud is required.", "Building and automating cloud infrastructure (IaC) is expected.", "Python programming and general software development for cloud‑based applications are preferred or a plus.", "Working with object storage (e.g., S3), unstructured data pipelines, and data‑security concepts is needed.", "Familiarity with monitoring and logging tools such as Datadog, New Relic, Splunk, Prometheus, ELK Stack, and Grafana is required.", "Exposure to Azure Data Lake, Azure SQL/DW, Azure Synapse, Azure Data Factory, T‑SQL, and data modeling is beneficial for cloud data engineering roles.", "Participating in code reviews, unit testing, and documentation using version control and collaboration tools is expected.", "Strong verbal and written communication skills and ability to work in a team are important."], "verdicts": [{"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}, {"verdict": "yes", "reason": null}], "verbose_logs": "Statements:
[
    "Entry‑level cloud engineer roles commonly look for practical experience with cloud platforms, infrastructure‑as‑code, scripting, monitoring, and basic software development concepts.",
    "Hands‑on experience with AWS, Azure, and/or Google Cloud is required.",
    "Building and automating cloud infrastructure (IaC) is expected.",
    "Python programming and general software development for cloud‑based applications are preferred or a plus.",
    "Working with object storage (e.g., S3), unstructured data pipelines, and data‑security concepts is needed.",
    "Familiarity with monitoring and logging tools such as Datadog, New Relic, Splunk, Prometheus, ELK Stack, and Grafana is required.",
    "Exposure to Azure Data Lake, Azure SQL/DW, Azure Synapse, Azure Data Factory, T‑SQL, and data modeling is beneficial for cloud data engineering roles.",
    "Participating in code reviews, unit testing, and documentation using version control and collaboration tools is expected.",
    "Strong verbal and written communication skills and ability to work in a team are important."
] 

